@startuml ProposalC_GitHubNative
title Proposal C - GitHub-Native split (snapshot 2026-05-20)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

actor "PowerShell user" as User
actor "GitHub viewer / community" as Viewer
actor "Keith\n(solo operator)" as Keith
actor "Future collaborator" as Future

package "Public - visible to anyone on the internet" {
  cloud "GitHub repo: greenmtnsun/GitEasy" as PubRepo {
    component "Module code + Tests + Examples" as Code
    component "README, LICENSE, CHANGELOG, CONTRIBUTING" as Top
    component "docs/UML, docs/SECURITY-FINDINGS-*" as Docs
  }
  cloud "GitHub Issues\n(on the public repo)" as Issues {
    component "Community bug reports" as Bugs
    component "Roadmap-labeled items\n(public roadmap signal)" as Roadmap
  }
  cloud "GitHub Wiki\n(separate <repo>.wiki.git)" as Wiki {
    component "Extended user docs\n(install guide, cookbook, FAQ)" as WikiContent
  }
  cloud "PowerShell Gallery" as PSG {
    component "GitEasy package" as Pkg
  }
}

package "Private - Keith only" {
  cloud "GitHub Project board\n(private, attached to public repo)" as Board {
    component "Internal planning\n(sprint queue, prioritization,\nstatus columns)" as Sprint
  }
  folder "Local filesystem only" as Local {
    component ".claude/ session data\n(gitignored, no cloud backup\nunless externally configured)" as AI
    component "Dev tooling scaffolds\n(Build-*UnitTests.ps1,\nUpdate-*Wiki.ps1)" as DevTools
  }
}

User --> Pkg : install
User --> PubRepo : reads docs
Viewer --> PubRepo : reads code, CHANGELOG, security docs
Viewer --> Issues : files bug, reads roadmap
Viewer --> Wiki : reads extended docs
Keith --> PubRepo : commits releases
Keith --> Issues : triages, responds, labels
Keith --> Wiki : authors extended docs
Keith --> Board : drags cards, sets priority
Keith --> Local : session work
Keith --> PSG : Publish-Module
Future ..> Board : invited as collaborator

note bottom of Roadmap
  Public roadmap = inbound-funnel signal.
  Visible to anyone; commits Keith to
  ongoing maintenance honesty. A stale
  roadmap is brand-negative for anti-vibe.
end note

note bottom of Local
  AI session data is local-only by default.
  Cloud backup requires a separate decision
  (external service, OR fold to Proposal D).
end note

@enduml
